  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Four equal point charges <math><mi>Q</mi></math> each are placed in the <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math> plane at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> . The work required to put a fifth charge <math><mi>Q</mi></math> at the origin of the coordinate system will be:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "t2uAR",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CxKJB",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dSC2D",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bGfEd",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Work done in bringing the fifth charge at origin is equal to change in the potential energy of the system of charges.</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>U</mi></math><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></math> if&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (assumed)<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the work done in bringing the fifth charge at the origin is&nbsp;<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p></blockquote>",
